  _root_.GlobalTheory.AscFin.EndsPf.Chr.psiBes_eq_star_besChar W.ψ W.ψ_std (G.colDec D.R.m h1 h2) (by have := D.R.two_le_m; obtain ⟨a, ha⟩ := D.R.m_even; omega) d o ζ hd hz

